summary:
AudioCodes logo

Key Points

Modest revenue growth but weaker profitability: Q4 revenue was $62.6M (up 1.7%) and FY2025 revenue was $245.6M (up 1.4%), while GAAP Q4 net income fell to $1.9M ($0.07/share) from $6.8M a year earlier; management guided 2026 revenue of $247M–$255M and non‑GAAP EPS of $0.60–$0.75. Strategic shift to VoiceAI and managed services: AudioCodes is repositioning as an “AI‑driven hybrid cloud” company with Live managed services plus VoiceAI driving ARR of $79M (up 22% y/y);
